     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Measure words and directions",
     "texto": [
      "**间** counts rooms and **名** counts people in a somewhat more formal register: **一间房间**, **一名老师**.",
      "To show direction, use **往 + direction + 走**. The words **左面** and **右面** name the left and right sides; the suffix 面 forms place names."
     ],
